msgstr "--gen preenche o novo mundo: não pode ir com --no-use nem --dry-run"

#. command help: didact combat status
#: didact/commands/combat.py
msgid ""
"--gm adds each fighter's `where`, `doing` and `plan` details: keep them current\n"
"with `didact about <fighter> where='…' doing='…' plan='…'` as the fight moves.\n"
"Fighters come and go: `didact combat join <fighter>` brings one in, and\n"
"`didact combat leave <fighter> --why fled` takes one out."
msgstr ""
"--gm acrescenta os detalhes `where`, `doing` e `plan` de cada combatente: mantém-nos atualizados\n"
"com `didact about <fighter> where='…' doing='…' plan='…'` à medida que o combate avança.\n"
"Os combatentes entram e saem: `didact combat join <fighter>` traz um para o combate, e\n"
"`didact combat leave <fighter> --why fled` tira um."

